Third-party software in this repository
=======================================

explainer.html inlines two third-party libraries so that it works as one file with no network access. Their own
license headers are kept in the file. Nothing else in this repository includes third-party code.

  - Tailwind CSS 3.4.17, Play CDN build (MIT). The build also bundles small MIT-licensed packages whose headers
    are kept in the file: fill-range, is-number and to-regex-range (Copyright (c) 2014-present / 2015-present,
    Jon Schlinkert) and cssesc 3.0.0 (Mathias Bynens).
  - Lucide 1.26.0 (ISC; some icons are derived from Feather, MIT).

The container images that deploy builds download further software at build time: openvscode-server (MIT),
Claude Code, the CLI and the VS Code extension (Anthropic's terms: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/legal-and-compliance),
the AWS CLI v2 (Apache-2.0), mcp-proxy-for-aws and its dependencies (Apache-2.0 and others, pinned in
box/requirements-mcp-proxy.txt), ws (MIT), Ubuntu 24.04 and the AWS Lambda Node.js 24 base image. They are not
part of this repository; each is used under its own license.


